1
00:00:14,484 --> 00:00:18,029
<font color="white">虽然上一次没办法和你认真交手</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:18,113 --> 00:00:20,574
<font color="white">这次也许能好好跟你玩一场</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:51,688 --> 00:00:53,065
<font color="white">看招</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:58,862 --> 00:01:03,116
<font color="white">你难道是会轻易被解决掉的类型？</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:01:04,868 --> 00:01:07,662
<font color="white">这样啊 真是太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:07,746 --> 00:01:10,707
<font color="white">看来是我担心过头了</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:13,585 --> 00:01:15,420
<font color="white">给我住手</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:16,546 --> 00:01:18,131
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:19,508 --> 00:01:20,884
<font color="white">进次郎人在哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:20,967 --> 00:01:22,886
<font color="white">让他逃走了</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:46,868 --> 00:01:49,913
<font color="white">-你这家伙…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-之后再来处理她</font></font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:01:51,164 --> 00:01:55,502
<font color="white">你那句话的意思是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">要把最喜欢的留到最后吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:57,003 --> 00:01:58,964
<font color="white">算了 就这样吧</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:59,047 --> 00:02:01,133
<font color="white">我们下次再见</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:03:35,769 --> 00:03:37,020
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,494
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:03:58,208 --> 00:03:59,417
<font color="white">喂</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:04:02,254 --> 00:04:04,714
<font color="white">来 进来吧</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:04:07,550 --> 00:04:09,135
<font color="white">竟然有这种地方？</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:04:09,219 --> 00:04:11,179
<font color="white">这里就像是我的秘密基地</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:04:11,263 --> 00:04:12,973
<font color="white">是安全屋吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:04:13,056 --> 00:04:14,849
<font color="white">不用分那么细啦</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:04:14,933 --> 00:04:16,768
<font color="white">你就放松一下吧</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:04:19,229 --> 00:04:20,313
<font color="white">你一定饿了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:04:20,397 --> 00:04:22,774
<font color="white">来 这个红豆面包给你吃</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:04:22,857 --> 00:04:24,651
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:04:24,734 --> 00:04:27,737
<font color="white">毕竟饿着肚子就没办法打仗啊</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,035
<font color="white">不用担心啦</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:04:34,119 --> 00:04:36,288
<font color="white">那只是普通的自来水</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:36,788 --> 00:04:38,123
<font color="white">谢谢</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:43,712 --> 00:04:45,171
<font color="white">你真的长大了呢</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:46,256 --> 00:04:48,174
<font color="white">我小时候和你见过面吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:48,258 --> 00:04:50,010
<font color="white">到底有没有呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:50,093 --> 00:04:51,136
<font color="white">是有还是没有？</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:51,219 --> 00:04:52,262
<font color="white">到了我这个年纪</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:52,345 --> 00:04:54,806
<font color="white">很多小事都不记得了</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:55,890 --> 00:04:58,810
<font color="white">那你为什么要帮我？</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:59,394 --> 00:05:01,229
<font color="white">因为我一直守望着你</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:05:01,896 --> 00:05:06,359
<font color="white">看着早田进的儿子</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">作为奥特曼逐渐成长的模样</font></font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:05:07,652 --> 00:05:10,739
<font color="white">所以你也知道我爸是…</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:11,698 --> 00:05:14,034
<font color="white">你是指他是奥特曼的事情？</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:14,659 --> 00:05:15,827
<font color="white">我早就注意到了</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:16,828 --> 00:05:18,788
<font color="white">从我还在科学特搜队的时候开始</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:18,872 --> 00:05:21,082
<font color="white">那是真的吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:21,166 --> 00:05:25,003
<font color="white">但你是如何得知关于我们的事情？</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:26,087 --> 00:05:27,547
<font color="white">跟那个时候比起来</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:05:27,630 --> 00:05:30,133
<font color="white">现在变得越来越便利</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:05:30,216 --> 00:05:32,010
<font color="white">过来这里</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:35,221 --> 00:05:37,891
<font color="white">就算不在科学特搜队</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:05:38,391 --> 00:05:43,772
<font color="white">我还是能得到这种程度的信息</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:47,275 --> 00:05:48,318
<font color="white">看吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:50,195 --> 00:05:51,654
<font color="white">不会吧</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:51,738 --> 00:05:54,741
<font color="white">难道你侵入了科学特搜队的数据库？</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:54,824 --> 00:05:58,119
<font color="white">别这样 话不要说得这么难听啦</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:58,203 --> 00:06:03,458
<font color="white">我只是刚好猜到密码</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">然后进去稍微偷看一下</font></font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:06:04,459 --> 00:06:07,337
<font color="white">那就是黑客的行为啦</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:06:07,921 --> 00:06:09,464
<font color="white">这可是犯罪行为啊</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:09,547 --> 00:06:12,801
<font color="white">真是的 最近的奥特曼不只是体型小</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:06:12,884 --> 00:06:14,928
<font color="white">说起话来也很吹毛求疵</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:15,011 --> 00:06:17,055
<font color="white">你那么死脑筋</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:17,138 --> 00:06:19,557
<font color="white">可是会变成梅菲斯特的猎物喔</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:19,641 --> 00:06:20,725
<font color="white">梅菲斯特？</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:06:20,809 --> 00:06:27,023
<font color="white">没错 就是前阵子大放厥词</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">说要打败奥特曼的那个外星人</font></font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:06:27,690 --> 00:06:29,359
<font color="white">这家伙是…</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:29,442 --> 00:06:32,821
<font color="white">你说他宣告要打败</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">奥特曼又是怎么回事？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:32,904 --> 00:06:35,323
<font color="white">什么？你没听说吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:36,157 --> 00:06:40,912
<font color="white">这家伙不就是打败你爸的外星人吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:42,122 --> 00:06:47,085
<font color="white">你究竟是何方神圣？</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:48,044 --> 00:06:51,089
<font color="white">其实你明明就知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">奥特曼不是坏人 对不对？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:51,172 --> 00:06:54,759
<font color="white">然而他们只因为好玩</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:54,843 --> 00:06:57,262
<font color="white">就随口乱说些有的没的</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:57,804 --> 00:06:59,806
<font color="white">太过分了</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:02,475 --> 00:07:05,270
<font color="white">已经过三小时了呢</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:05,353 --> 00:07:07,147
<font color="white">奥特曼！</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:07:08,148 --> 00:07:10,150
<font color="white">你是科学特搜队的成员？</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:10,233 --> 00:07:14,571
<font color="white">我是觉得这样的登场方式</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">比较能让你认出我啦</font></font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:16,114 --> 00:07:19,409
<font color="white">不过很可惜 我不是科学特搜队的人</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:07:19,492 --> 00:07:21,995
<font color="white">我记得你</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:22,078 --> 00:07:24,956
<font color="white">虽然装扮成奥特曼的样子</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">但你其实只是为了钱</font></font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:25,039 --> 00:07:27,292
<font color="white">把我形容得还真难听啊</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:27,375 --> 00:07:29,752
<font color="white">我跟那种家伙没什么好说的</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:29,836 --> 00:07:32,297
<font color="white">你等的人不会来喔</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:34,048
<font color="white">你这是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:34,132 --> 00:07:37,677
<font color="white">贝姆拉或许已经被那些家伙消灭了</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:38,303 --> 00:07:39,637
<font color="white">你说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:39,721 --> 00:07:41,681
<font color="white">我只是个传话者</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:42,682 --> 00:07:44,142
<font color="white">他是这么说的</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:48,771
<font color="white">“真相就在光之力量中”</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:48,855 --> 00:07:51,483
<font color="white">什么？他到底在说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:52,066 --> 00:07:53,067
<font color="white">谁知道</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:53,735 --> 00:07:57,572
<font color="white">只是觉得这对你可能会有帮助</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:57,655 --> 00:08:00,450
<font color="white">那我就告辞了</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:08:01,201 --> 00:08:02,994
<font color="white">再见了</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:08:09,584 --> 00:08:11,211
<font color="white">在12年前</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:08:11,294 --> 00:08:16,716
<font color="white">前科学特搜队的队员们各奔东西</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:08:18,134 --> 00:08:22,889
<font color="white">井手那时候也邀我回归科学特搜队</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:24,432 --> 00:08:26,100
<font color="white">你觉得如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:08:26,184 --> 00:08:29,020
<font color="white">看来早田有意愿回来</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:08:29,103 --> 00:08:32,190
<font color="white">我希望你也能一并回归</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:08:32,774 --> 00:08:34,776
<font color="white">井手 很抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:08:35,443 --> 00:08:38,655
<font color="white">我就当作没听过你说的那些话</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:08:39,239 --> 00:08:41,282
<font color="white">到底是为什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:41,366 --> 00:08:46,704
<font color="white">这地方跟我们待过的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那个科学特搜队没什么两样</font></font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:47,872 --> 00:08:49,249
<font color="white">但是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:49,332 --> 00:08:51,042
<font color="white">内在却完全不同</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:51,125 --> 00:08:52,835
<font color="white">你这是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:53,753 --> 00:08:57,840
<font color="white">运用外星人那些超乎想象的技术</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:57,924 --> 00:09:01,177
<font color="white">那当然也有办法自行创造奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:03,721
<font color="white">不过呢</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:09:03,805 --> 00:09:06,057
<font color="white">一旦染指那种可怕的东西</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:08,935
<font color="white">你们难道不怕会控制不住自己吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:09:09,018 --> 00:09:12,272
<font color="white">所以才会需要像早田和你这种</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:09:12,355 --> 00:09:14,941
<font color="white">深知那股力量</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">有多可怕的人来协助我们啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:09:16,276 --> 00:09:20,321
<font color="white">我只是上个时代幸存者</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:09:20,905 --> 00:09:24,576
<font color="white">我们以前总是不顾后果 全力以赴</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:09:24,659 --> 00:09:27,120
<font color="white">但现在已经不是那种时代了</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:09:28,204 --> 00:09:29,747
<font color="white">与其如此</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:09:30,957 --> 00:09:36,379
<font color="white">我宁愿监看着你们</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">确保你们不要因此误入歧途</font></font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:09:37,964 --> 00:09:40,717
<font color="white">如果你们干出了什么蠢事</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,552
<font color="white">我可不会放过你们</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:09:44,512 --> 00:09:45,930
<font color="white">事情就是这样</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:09:46,014 --> 00:09:48,641
<font color="white">我表面上装成一般的市民</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:09:48,725 --> 00:09:51,978
<font color="white">却像这样在暗地里行动</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:09:52,854 --> 00:09:55,940
<font color="white">也多亏如此 我才能救到你</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:09:56,524 --> 00:10:00,403
<font color="white">我都想称赞一下选择踏上</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">跟伙伴们不同道路的自己呢</font></font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:10:03,448 --> 00:10:05,074
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:10:05,867 --> 00:10:08,202
<font color="white">先不论你的做法如何</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:10:08,286 --> 00:10:10,204
<font color="white">真的很谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:10:11,331 --> 00:10:12,915
<font color="white">那我走了</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:10:12,999 --> 00:10:14,667
<font color="white">喂 等等啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:10:14,751 --> 00:10:16,794
<font color="white">你是打算去哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:10:16,878 --> 00:10:18,254
<font color="white">我不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:10:19,213 --> 00:10:21,382
<font color="white">但是我一定得走</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:10:21,466 --> 00:10:23,009
<font color="white">你现在就算出去</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:10:24,093 --> 00:10:27,347
<font color="white">也只会闯入科学特搜队的包围网</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:10:28,431 --> 00:10:31,100
<font color="white">不然就是陷入梅菲斯特的计谋</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:31,184 --> 00:10:32,560
<font color="white">那么…</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:33,102 --> 00:10:34,771
<font color="white">我到底该怎么做？</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:34,854 --> 00:10:36,356
<font color="white">这个嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:36,439 --> 00:10:39,984
<font color="white">你暂时也只能在这里等了</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:40,818 --> 00:10:41,819
<font color="white">等什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:44,822 --> 00:10:47,492
<font color="white">等机会到来啊</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:10:48,785 --> 00:10:52,413
<font color="white">虽然那小子出现在</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">井手先生说的那个地方…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:10:52,497 --> 00:10:53,331
<font color="white">有人从旁干预啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:10:53,414 --> 00:10:57,335
<font color="white">那个从旁干预的人到底是谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:10:57,418 --> 00:11:00,129
<font color="white">岚大助</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:11:00,213 --> 00:11:01,547
<font color="white">是那个前科学特搜队队员？</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:11:02,131 --> 00:11:04,092
<font color="white">像他那种人为什么会做出这种事？</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:11:04,592 --> 00:11:05,843
<font color="white">听好了</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:05,927 --> 00:11:08,096
<font color="white">梅菲斯特那家伙是这么说的</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:08,179 --> 00:11:10,181
<font color="white">也就是说</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:10,765 --> 00:11:14,352
<font color="white">我们要干掉四名奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:15,937 --> 00:11:18,856
<font color="white">早田已被对方打败</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:21,192
<font color="white">现在剩下三位</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:21,275 --> 00:11:24,695
<font color="white">其中一个自然就是你</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:24,779 --> 00:11:28,699
<font color="white">另外两位指的是谁呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:28,783 --> 00:11:30,410
<font color="white">谁知道呢</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:11:31,702 --> 00:11:33,871
<font color="white">很好 打开了</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:33,955 --> 00:11:38,209
<font color="white">现存的奥特曼共有六位</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:11:38,292 --> 00:11:41,421
<font color="white">再加上贝姆拉的话就是七位</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:11:42,338 --> 00:11:43,881
<font color="white">在此之中</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:11:43,965 --> 00:11:48,845
<font color="white">身为奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你跟早田的共通点是什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:11:48,928 --> 00:11:49,971
<font color="white">（奥特曼、佐菲）</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:11:50,972 --> 00:11:52,473
<font color="white">斯派修姆光线！</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:11:52,557 --> 00:11:53,599
<font color="white">原来如此</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:11:53,683 --> 00:11:58,521
<font color="white">假设我们称它为“光之巨人的力量”</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:11:59,605 --> 00:12:02,650
<font color="white">那么贝姆拉也是…</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:12:02,733 --> 00:12:04,610
<font color="white">我想是的</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:12:04,694 --> 00:12:11,576
<font color="white">如果梅菲斯特那混蛋的目的是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">消灭光之巨人的那股力量…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:12:11,659 --> 00:12:16,164
<font color="white">他的第四个目标</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也拥有斯派修姆的力量</font></font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:12:16,247 --> 00:12:21,502
<font color="white">但梅菲斯特宣称 已打倒两个奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:12:22,587 --> 00:12:24,839
<font color="white">我心中只有不好的预感</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:12:27,175 --> 00:12:30,052
<font color="white">（警察署）</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:12:30,136 --> 00:12:33,639
{\an8}<font color="white">（急速上升热门视频第一名</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">奥特曼破坏淡谷总集篇）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:12:33,723 --> 00:12:37,018
{\an8}<font color="white">你为什么要看那种奥特曼的视频？</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:12:37,101 --> 00:12:39,479
<font color="white">有些事让我很在意</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:12:40,354 --> 00:12:43,900
<font color="white">“真相就在光之力量中”</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:12:45,485 --> 00:12:47,403
<font color="white">那到底是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:12:47,987 --> 00:12:50,323
<font color="white">不管怎样 真是太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:12:50,406 --> 00:12:53,117
<font color="white">感觉远藤先生找回干劲了</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:12:53,201 --> 00:12:55,745
<font color="white">你就别管我了</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:13:00,541 --> 00:13:02,877
<font color="white">这台灯感觉快没电了</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,045
<font color="white">我拿新的来换</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:13:04,128 --> 00:13:06,589
<font color="white">-谢谢</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不客气</font></font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:13:07,173 --> 00:13:11,219
<font color="white">资料里留有岚前队员以前的住址</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:13:11,302 --> 00:13:13,179
<font color="white">我们要不要先调查这个住址？</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:13:13,262 --> 00:13:14,430
<font color="white">没用的</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:13:14,514 --> 00:13:18,434
<font color="white">他可是能独自对付科学特搜队的人</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:13:18,518 --> 00:13:21,771
<font color="white">最后只会发现是假情报吧</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:13:21,854 --> 00:13:24,023
<font color="white">你说得对</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:13:27,401 --> 00:13:29,237
<font color="white">你要去哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,905
<font color="white">我有私事要办</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:13:30,988 --> 00:13:32,281
<font color="white">请等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:13:32,365 --> 00:13:34,325
<font color="white">我能问你一件事吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:13:34,408 --> 00:13:35,576
<font color="white">什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:39,288
<font color="white">你那个时候为什么要放走进次郎？</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:13:39,372 --> 00:13:40,915
<font color="white">放走他？</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:13:40,998 --> 00:13:44,335
<font color="white">我只是被那位前队员的突袭摆了一道</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:13:44,418 --> 00:13:46,003
<font color="white">是真的吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:13:46,879 --> 00:13:48,005
<font color="white">那我反问你</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:13:48,839 --> 00:13:54,971
<font color="white">你真的认为这次的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">一连串事件都是那小子做的？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:13:55,054 --> 00:13:56,847
<font color="white">你这是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:13:56,931 --> 00:13:59,517
<font color="white">那家伙虽然冒失</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:04,021
<font color="white">但我不认为他会如此草率</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">引发像这次的事件</font></font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:14:04,105 --> 00:14:07,567
<font color="white">我大概懂你的意思 但是…</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:14:11,112 --> 00:14:13,406
<font color="white">我没办法否定自己看到的那幕</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:14:14,282 --> 00:14:16,325
<font color="white">那就该更深入去检验</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:14:16,409 --> 00:14:20,621
<font color="white">所有的证据都指出是那家伙干的</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:14:20,705 --> 00:14:22,665
<font color="white">找不到半点破绽</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:14:24,333 --> 00:14:28,963
<font color="white">恰恰这点让我觉得不对劲</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:14:33,634 --> 00:14:35,136
<font color="white">真厉害</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:14:35,219 --> 00:14:37,138
<font color="white">诸星弹</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:14:37,221 --> 00:14:41,684
<font color="white">他的战斗力和思考能力都相当优异</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:14:41,767 --> 00:14:44,812
<font color="white">但他并没有光之巨人的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:14:45,354 --> 00:14:48,232
<font color="white">而且他的性格很极端</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:14:48,316 --> 00:14:49,525
<font color="white">（北斗星司 王牌）</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:14:49,609 --> 00:14:51,402
<font color="white">北斗星司</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:14:51,485 --> 00:14:53,613
<font color="white">他身穿以外星人亚普鲁的技术</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:14:53,696 --> 00:14:57,783
<font color="white">开发出来的王牌装甲展开活动</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:14:58,868 --> 00:15:03,080
<font color="white">我们应该将这家伙归类于</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">因装甲而获取力量的其中一人</font></font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:15:03,873 --> 00:15:07,084
<font color="white">我觉得那家伙现在就已经够危险了</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:15:07,793 --> 00:15:10,171
<font color="white">杰克 真实姓名不详</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:15:11,047 --> 00:15:15,551
<font color="white">外星人街的情报贩子</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也是前格斗冠军</font></font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:15:16,260 --> 00:15:19,597
<font color="white">他能以人类的身体</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">与外星人打得不相上下</font></font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:15:20,681 --> 00:15:23,184
<font color="white">虽然他纯粹只是一个地球人</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:15:23,267 --> 00:15:25,603
<font color="white">但他身上有很多谜团也是事实</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:15:26,187 --> 00:15:28,940
<font color="white">东光太郎</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:15:29,023 --> 00:15:30,650
<font color="white">是一位记者</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:15:30,733 --> 00:15:32,109
<font color="white">他在被卷入过去发生的</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:15:32,193 --> 00:15:35,571
<font color="white">大量市民消失事件时</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:15:35,655 --> 00:15:40,493
<font color="white">情报指出他因某种原因</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">而获得特殊能力</font></font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:15:40,993 --> 00:15:43,371
<font color="white">但我不确定其中究竟有几分真实</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:15:43,454 --> 00:15:46,958
<font color="white">我不是很了解太郎先生的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:15:47,041 --> 00:15:50,670
<font color="white">不过能感受到他拥有的热情</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:15:52,463 --> 00:15:54,590
<font color="white">然后就是贝姆拉</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:15:54,674 --> 00:15:56,258
<font color="white">没有人知道他的真面目</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:15:56,342 --> 00:15:57,218
<font color="white">（贝姆拉 无资料）</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:15:57,301 --> 00:15:59,845
<font color="white">他最初虽然与你们敌对</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:15:59,929 --> 00:16:01,973
<font color="white">不过在黄金城塞之战的时候</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:16:02,056 --> 00:16:04,767
<font color="white">他保护了淡谷的城镇</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:16:04,850 --> 00:16:06,477
<font color="white">虽然身上还有许多未解之谜</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:08,396
<font color="white">但他也能使出斯派修姆光线</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:16:08,479 --> 00:16:12,358
<font color="white">显然拥有光之巨人的力量</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">这是无庸置疑的</font></font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:16:12,441 --> 00:16:13,693
<font color="white">也就是说</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:16:13,776 --> 00:16:17,196
<font color="white">梅菲斯特说的四位奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:21,117
<font color="white">只剩下一位还无法厘清身份</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:16:21,951 --> 00:16:25,079
<font color="white">从这些情报看来</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:16:25,162 --> 00:16:28,708
<font color="white">和你们几个可能具有共同点的人</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:16:28,791 --> 00:16:30,793
<font color="white">就是太郎了啊</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:16:30,876 --> 00:16:33,462
<font color="white">即使有点牵强</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:16:34,672 --> 00:16:35,881
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:16:36,465 --> 00:16:37,717
<font color="white">没什么</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:16:38,884 --> 00:16:43,389
<font color="white">我只是在想</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">为什么你会这么亲切地帮我</font></font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:16:43,472 --> 00:16:45,725
<font color="white">因为你是早田的儿子啊</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:16:45,808 --> 00:16:47,560
<font color="white">怎么可能不对你伸出援手</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:16:48,561 --> 00:16:49,854
<font color="white">这是原因之一</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:16:50,938 --> 00:16:53,691
<font color="white">我觉得井手也希望我那么做</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:16:53,774 --> 00:16:59,155
<font color="white">井手先生？但他是下令要抓我的人</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:16:59,238 --> 00:17:00,531
<font color="white">表面上是这样</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:17:01,115 --> 00:17:04,160
<font color="white">然而那家伙一定很担心你</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:17:04,243 --> 00:17:07,580
<font color="white">而且现在早田不在了 他一定更忧心</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:17:08,164 --> 00:17:10,916
<font color="white">你怎么知道会是那样？</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:17:11,500 --> 00:17:15,129
<font color="white">他一直以来像这样</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">放任我在外就是证明</font></font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:17:15,212 --> 00:17:21,010
<font color="white">就是为了现在这种时候</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那家伙才会让我自由行动</font></font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:17:21,886 --> 00:17:25,222
<font color="white">岚先生 我果然还是得先走</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:17:25,306 --> 00:17:26,390
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:17:26,474 --> 00:17:28,017
<font color="white">你要我说几遍才会懂？</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:32,313
<font color="white">科学特搜队和梅菲斯特一伙人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">可都是拼了命要找你</font></font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:17:33,022 --> 00:17:34,106
<font color="white">你现在要是出去</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:17:34,190 --> 00:17:36,192
<font color="white">可是正中他们的下怀啊</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:17:36,275 --> 00:17:37,610
<font color="white">我知道</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:17:37,693 --> 00:17:39,236
<font color="white">但我还是得走</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:42,156
<font color="white">我必须去证明自己的清白</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:17:42,239 --> 00:17:47,703
<font color="white">我觉得那才是让井手先生、岚先生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">和我爸安心的最佳方法</font></font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:17:48,788 --> 00:17:51,207
<font color="white">你这种一说出口就绝不让步的地方</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:17:51,290 --> 00:17:52,583
<font color="white">也跟你老爸一模一样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:17:55,252 --> 00:17:59,381
<font color="white">那家伙虽然说自己没有当时的记忆</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:17:59,465 --> 00:18:01,759
<font color="white">但他其实并没有忘记所有的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:18:02,676 --> 00:18:04,136
<font color="white">我觉得早田他自己也是</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:07,598
<font color="white">边怀有烦恼边持续担任奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:18:08,724 --> 00:18:11,060
<font color="white">就像你现在这样</font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:18:11,644 --> 00:18:13,437
<font color="white">爸也曾经这样？</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:18:13,521 --> 00:18:16,315
<font color="white">虽然现在有很多人对你指手画脚</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:18:16,398 --> 00:18:18,901
<font color="white">以前其实也发生过很多事</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:18:19,401 --> 00:18:22,822
<font color="white">像是破坏了城镇之类的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:18:23,614 --> 00:18:27,159
<font color="white">每当遭逢那种状况</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">早田都会去探望受害者</font></font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:18:27,868 --> 00:18:31,122
<font color="white">尽管我们都叫他不要去</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">因为只会让事情变得复杂</font></font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:18:31,872 --> 00:18:33,916
<font color="white">可是那家伙并没有因此罢手</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:18:35,918 --> 00:18:40,756
<font color="white">你也要一直保持这样的你喔</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:18:43,551 --> 00:18:46,428
<font color="white">（要一直保持这样的你喔）</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:18:46,512 --> 00:18:48,264
<font color="white">你刚才说的那句话…</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:18:48,347 --> 00:18:49,515
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:18:50,850 --> 00:18:53,435
<font color="white">-以前早田曾这么跟我说过</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:18:54,103 --> 00:18:55,855
<font color="white">那我走了</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:18:55,938 --> 00:18:57,815
<font color="white">等一下 岚</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:18:59,108 --> 00:19:01,402
<font color="white">我明白你的想法了</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:19:01,485 --> 00:19:03,863
<font color="white">这的确像是你会做出的选择</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:19:03,946 --> 00:19:05,614
<font color="white">是吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:19:05,698 --> 00:19:10,995
<font color="white">岚 要一直保持这样的你喔</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:19:12,329 --> 00:19:14,123
<font color="white">岚先生</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:19:14,707 --> 00:19:18,377
<font color="white">我好像知道自己该怎么做了</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:19,295
<font color="white">你要怎么做？</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:19:21,172 --> 00:19:25,885
<font color="white">要去查明爸究竟想对我传达什么</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:19:25,968 --> 00:19:29,930
<font color="white">那正是我现在应该要做的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:19:31,098 --> 00:19:32,224
<font color="white">这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:19:32,808 --> 00:19:34,810
<font color="white">也许你那么想是对的</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:19:34,894 --> 00:19:36,729
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:19:36,812 --> 00:19:39,523
<font color="white">总之啊 你如果遇到什么麻烦</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:19:39,607 --> 00:19:41,275
<font color="white">都可以随时来倚靠我</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:19:42,067 --> 00:19:43,485
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:19:47,656 --> 00:19:49,033
<font color="white">这是什么声音？</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:19:49,116 --> 00:19:50,951
<font color="white">看来有人来访啊</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:19:59,126 --> 00:20:02,171
<font color="white">我说啊 灯光太刺眼了吧</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:20:02,254 --> 00:20:05,466
<font color="white">喔 刚才的灯泡太旧了</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:20:05,549 --> 00:20:07,051
<font color="white">我换了一个新的</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:20:07,134 --> 00:20:09,261
<font color="white">这样啊 谢啦</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:20:09,345 --> 00:20:11,805
<font color="white">换成了LED灯所以很亮</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:20:14,516 --> 00:20:15,893
<font color="white">“真相就在</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:20:15,976 --> 00:20:17,895
<font color="white">光之力量中”</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:20:19,063 --> 00:20:21,857
<font color="white">斯派修姆光线的颜色</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:20:24,109 --> 00:20:25,903
<font color="white">原来是这样！</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:20:26,528 --> 00:20:28,906
<font color="white">怎么了？远藤先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:20:28,989 --> 00:20:30,783
<font color="white">你等一下啦</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:20:47,299 --> 00:20:48,509
<font color="white">（侦测到动作）</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:20:49,718 --> 00:20:50,761
<font color="white">（连线中断）</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:20:51,470 --> 00:20:54,765
<font color="white">第二台勘测无人机也失去信号了</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:21:02,481 --> 00:21:03,774
<font color="white">好厉害</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:21:04,275 --> 00:21:07,903
<font color="white">我待过的科学特搜队</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">才不会这么轻易被解决</font></font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:21:07,987 --> 00:21:10,114
<font color="white">我们有一种无重力弹</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:21:10,197 --> 00:21:12,866
<font color="white">是打败那个积顿的超强力武器</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:21:14,118 --> 00:21:15,828
<font color="white">积顿？</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:21:20,874 --> 00:21:22,710
<font color="white">原来如此</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:21:22,793 --> 00:21:24,169
<font color="white">该不会是这样吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:21:24,253 --> 00:21:25,546
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:21:26,088 --> 00:21:31,302
<font color="white">积顿是我爸还是奥特曼时</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">最后对打的敌人吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:21:31,385 --> 00:21:33,429
<font color="white">对啊 这件事很有名吧</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:21:34,263 --> 00:21:36,056
<font color="white">岚先生</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:21:36,140 --> 00:21:38,851
<font color="white">我也许能掌握到一些线索</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:21:48,152 --> 00:21:49,445
<font color="white">玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:21:49,987 --> 00:21:53,198
<font color="white">玲奈 我可能发现</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:21:53,282 --> 00:21:54,533
<font color="white">那起复兴典礼事件的真相了</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:21:54,616 --> 00:21:56,869
<font color="white">奥特曼的光正是关键</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:22:04,084 --> 00:22:06,045
<font color="white">都是多亏了你</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:22:06,128 --> 00:22:09,798
<font color="white">我找到线索能解开那起事件的谜团了</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:22:09,882 --> 00:22:12,634
<font color="white">这样啊 那真是太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:24:07,249 --> 00:24:09,168
<font color="white">字幕翻译：蒋文昊</font><font color="white"></font>

